(ns kotoba.device.make-device-manager
  "make-device-manager -- addressed on its own.

  Split out of kotoba.lang.device on 2026-09-09 (ADR-2609091200). The unit
  here is the DEFINITION, and this repo's deps.edn names exactly the
  definitions it reaches -- nothing else.
"
  )

(defn make-device-manager
  "Make a device manager. `policy` is a wit policy (set of granted capability
  strings). `drivers` is a map of surface-key → Device. `opts` unused for now.
  Every device call is gated: a surface not in the policy returns :kotoba.lang.device/denied."
  [policy drivers opts]
  {:policy policy :drivers drivers :opts opts})
